# Architecture boundaries

Full rules: [`AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md). Automated gate: `tests/test_architecture_gates.py`.

- Cross-module imports in production code: only `src.<module>.api`.
- Adapters (`*_main.py` thin wrappers, `interfaces/`, `gui_min*.py`, `rule_editor/`, `interfaces/tk/`): only `src.*.api` for foreign modules; runtime via `src.runtime.api` only.
- Business logic stays in `src/` services; adapters orchestrate and render.
- Do not add root entry scripts or parallel CLI mains without explicit task scope — extend `interfaces/cli/*` or existing `*_main.py` owners.
- `src/testui/` has no Tkinter imports (presenters only).
